What is adapted from it here, rewritten (internal/controlplane/listening/xiaohongshu.go, issue #1362): the search
page's address (xiaohongshu/search.go makeSearchURL), the 发布时间 filter's options and the way an option is found in
the filter panel by its group's and its own text, hovered then clicked, then waited for until the feeds change
(search.go filterGroups, findFilterOption, waitFeedsChanged), the script that reads the search's state from
window.__INITIAL_STATE__ and the feeds it holds, notes only (search.go, search_ready.go searchReadinessJS, types.go
onlyNotes), an empty search taken as read only beside an answer that says there is no more (search_ready.go
parseSearchResponse), and the block read from the landing path, /website-login/captcha a verification and any other
/website-login a sign-in (xiaohongshu/page_check.go). Changed: no humanized pointer path or random delay; the page's
search answers are read from the browser context's record of its tab's responses (internal/controlplane/browser).
